        {
          "id": "52f3b476-dc5c-3097-a85f-de0a392dd30b",
          "content": {
            "id": "52f3b476-dc5c-3097-a85f-de0a392dd30b",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Trump's UK visit: US Big Tech to invest billions in UK's AI",
            "description": "<p>President Trump is visiting the UK to meet with Prime Minister Keir Starmer on Thursday, accompanied by several Big Tech CEOs. This comes as names like Microsoft (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MSFT\">MSFT</a>), Google (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GOOG\">GOOG</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GOOGL\">GOOGL</a>), Nvidia (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>), Salesforce (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CRM\">CRM</a>), OpenAI (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/OPAI.PVT\">OPAI.PVT</a>), and GSK (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GSK\">GSK</a>) pledged $42.3 billion worth of artificial intelligence (AI) infrastructure investments in the UK as part of the \"Tech Prosperity Deal.\"</p>\n<p>Yahoo Finance anchor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/ramzan-karmali/?fr=sycsrp_catchall\">Ramzan Karmali</a> joins Morning Brief with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/\">Julie Hyman</a> to discuss the details.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:10;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/morning-brief/\">Morning Brief</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "President Trump is visiting the UK to meet with Prime Minister Keir Starmer on Thursday, accompanied by several Big Tech CEOs. This comes as names like Microsoft (MSFT), Google (GOOG, GOOGL), Nvidia (NVDA), Salesforce (CRM), OpenAI (OPAI.PVT), and GSK (GSK) pledged $42.3 billion worth of artificial intelligence (AI) infrastructure investments in the UK as part of the \"Tech Prosperity Deal.\" Yahoo Finance anchor Ramzan Karmali joins Morning Brief with Julie Hyman to discuss the details. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Morning Brief.",
